      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file that integrates with a concrete external provider for email and password login. I will use Firebase Authentication for this task, as it is a widely used service for user authentication. The code will import the Firebase Admin SDK, initialize the app with the necessary credentials, and implement a function to sign in a user with email and password, returning the tokens. </thinking>\n",
