      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create a new email/password user account using an external provider, I will use the Firebase Authentication service. Firebase Authentication provides backend services, SDKs, and ready-made UI libraries to authenticate users to my app. I will import the Firebase Admin SDK to interact with the Firebase Authentication API. </thinking>\n",
